@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 3: Job Posting System

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Customer
actor Worker
actor Administrator as Admin
actor "Image Storage Service" as ImageStorage
actor "Realtime Notification Service" as Realtime

rectangle "Serviqo Job Posting System" {
  usecase "Post a job" as PostJob
  usecase "Enter job details,\ncategory, budget and urgency" as EnterDetails
  usecase "Specify city and area" as SpecifyLocation
  usecase "Upload job images\n(optional, up to five)" as UploadImages

  usecase "Manage own jobs" as ManageJobs
  usecase "View own jobs and\njob status" as ViewOwnJobs
  usecase "Edit an open job" as EditJob
  usecase "Delete an open job" as DeleteJob
  usecase "Mark an active job\nas completed" as CompleteJob

  usecase "Browse open jobs" as BrowseJobs
  usecase "Search/filter jobs by\ncategory, city or title" as FilterJobs
  usecase "View job details" as ViewJob
  usecase "Notify customer and\nassigned worker of completion" as NotifyCompletion

  usecase "Monitor platform jobs" as MonitorJobs
  usecase "View all jobs and\nfilter by status/category" as ViewAllJobs
}

Customer -- PostJob
Customer -- ManageJobs
Customer -- ViewJob
Worker -- BrowseJobs
Worker -- ViewJob
Admin -- MonitorJobs

PostJob ..> EnterDetails : <<include>>
PostJob ..> SpecifyLocation : <<include>>
PostJob ..> UploadImages : <<include>>
UploadImages -- ImageStorage

ManageJobs ..> ViewOwnJobs : <<include>>
EditJob ..> ManageJobs : <<extend>>
DeleteJob ..> ManageJobs : <<extend>>
CompleteJob ..> ManageJobs : <<extend>>
CompleteJob ..> NotifyCompletion : <<include>>
NotifyCompletion -- Realtime

BrowseJobs ..> FilterJobs : <<include>>
ViewJob ..> BrowseJobs : <<extend>>
MonitorJobs ..> ViewAllJobs : <<include>>

note right of EditJob
Only the customer who owns the job
can edit it, and only while its
status is open.
end note

note right of DeleteJob
Only the customer who owns the job
can delete it, and only while its
status is open.
end note

note bottom of BrowseJobs
Workers browse open jobs. Job listings
support category, city and title search,
with paginated results.
end note

note bottom of CompleteJob
Only the owning customer can mark
an active job as completed.
end note

note right of Admin
Admin job access is monitoring-only:
the implemented admin API lists and
filters jobs. It does not allow admins
to create, edit, delete or complete jobs.
end note

@enduml
